{
	"name": "dsh-toolbox",
	"version": "1.6.0",
	"description": "DSH 个人工具箱：memory（单仓记忆读注入：store 顶层共享、machines/<机器名>/ 本机私有；写改删走宿主工具，离线自检 npm run check:memory）＋see_image（图片交视觉模型转述）＋dispatch_task/dispatch_challenge 跑批工作流 v2 装配两件（任务书＋分诊档位＋直出可派参数；证伪门 brief＋裁决落 gate 事件；参数从台账回填）＋dispatch_batch（批次台账：start/gate/commit/review 四事件、状态从事件现推、review 收官即清该批行）＋usage_note（使用日志手记：订阅宿主工具调用事件，本包五件按天按机器旁路落记忆仓 memory/data/usage-log/ 的 jsonl——成功行只记参数键集与耗时、失败行保留 args 摘要与 error.info，写入与注册时按 14 天窗口轮转，与批次台账同一仓同步；结构化字段装不下的隐性坑用 note/tool/ok 补记一行）。单包多工具，逐工具隔离激活。",
	"license": "MIT",
	"type": "module",
	"main": "lib/index.js",
	"exports": {
		".": "./lib/index.js",
		"./client": "./lib/client.js",
		"./package.json": "./package.json",
		"./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
		"./icon": "./icon.svg"
	},
	"dsh": {
		"bundle": {
			"patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
		},
		"client": {
			"platform": "web",
			"inject": [
				"@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
				"@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings",
				"@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-plugin-manager",
				"@deepseek-ai/dsh-api-remotes"
			]
		}
	},
	"files": [
		"lib/**",
		"test/**",
		"scripts/**",
		"locale/**",
		"cordis.patch.yml",
		"icon.svg",
		"README.md",
		"LICENSE"
	],
	"scripts": {
		"test": "node --test",
		"check:memory": "node scripts/check-memory-index.mjs"
	},
	"engines": {
		"node": ">=18",
		"dsh": ">=0.2.0-rc.2 <0.3.0"
	},
	"keywords": [
		"deepseek-harness",
		"dsh",
		"cordis",
		"plugin",
		"memory",
		"vision",
		"dispatch"
	],
	"peerDependencies": {
		"@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": ">=0.2.0-rc.2 <0.3.0",
		"@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": ">=0.2.0-rc.2 <0.3.0",
		"@deepseek-ai/schemastery": ">=3.18.4 <4"
	},
	"repository": {
		"type": "git",
		"url": "git+https://github.com/maochouchou4-create/dsh-toolbox.git"
	}
}
